# Git LFS — large binary assets
*.onnx        filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
test-corpus/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip         filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Normalize line endings
*.lua    text eol=lf
*.rs     text eol=lf
*.toml   text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.xmp    text eol=lf
*.tmpl   text eol=lf
